  "_comment": "FROZEN, brain-independent evaluation corpus for the Part-2 brain (constitution results-first). Buyer intents = format x budget-ceiling x origin over oudfactory canonical values. The SAME corpus + SAME independent classifier (tests/lib/evalScorer.mjs) runs on the OLD and NEW brain. Anti-gaming: fixed denominator (never filtered); classification from RAW catalog, not matcher flags; no COMPROMISE->EXACT reclassification; profile coverage must not regress.",
